/**
  \defgroup kcl_cemrgapp_atrialstrainmotion kcl.cemrgapp.atrialstrainmotion
  \ingroup MITKPlugins

  \brief Regional strain of the left atrium from cine CT.

  The plugin builds a labelled, fibre-annotated surface mesh of the left atrium, tracks that mesh
  through the cardiac cycle, and turns the deformation into area strains and fibre strains. It
  holds no algorithms of its own. Every step calls into MitkCemrgAppModule, which runs the MIRTK
  binaries and the Docker images that do the work.

  See \ref kcl_cemrgapp_atrialstrainmotion for the user manual.

*/

/**
  \defgroup kcl_cemrgapp_atrialstrainmotion_internal Internal
  \ingroup kcl_cemrgapp_atrialstrainmotion

  \brief This subcategory includes the internal classes of the kcl.cemrgapp.atrialstrainmotion plugin. Other
  plugins must not rely on these classes. They contain implementation details and their interface
  may change at any time. We mean it.
*/
